From 7f910473560c078658c50d2c280217d301130de6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:58:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] utils: the license header of SampledValues.h and its test
 names Hades

utils/SampledValues.h and utils/test/TestSampledValues.cpp were written for Hades (the
values of the player information read twice a second) and are not in Kodi, but their
license header said "Copyright (C) 2026 Team Kodi" and "This file is part of Kodi". They
now say what the other files that Hades added to Kodi say: "Copyright (C) 2026 Hades" and
"This file is part of LibreELEC Hades. It is not in Kodi as Team Kodi publishes it." The
SPDX line (GPL-2.0-or-later) is unchanged.

t_headers.sh (every file that Hades added since the base of this version in the folders
of the player information and the settings has that header) fails before, with these two,
and passes after.
---
 xbmc/utils/SampledValues.h            | 4 ++--
 xbmc/utils/test/TestSampledValues.cpp | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/utils/SampledValues.h b/xbmc/utils/SampledValues.h
index 0c4e9d1..057d1be 100644
--- a/xbmc/utils/SampledValues.h
+++ b/xbmc/utils/SampledValues.h
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /*
- *  Copyright (C) 2026 Team Kodi
- *  This file is part of Kodi - https://kodi.tv
+ *  Copyright (C) 2026 Hades
+ *  This file is part of LibreELEC Hades. It is not in Kodi as Team Kodi publishes it.
  *
  *  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
  *  See LICENSES/README.md for more information.
diff --git a/xbmc/utils/test/TestSampledValues.cpp b/xbmc/utils/test/TestSampledValues.cpp
index a1ac1e6..9f04452 100644
--- a/xbmc/utils/test/TestSampledValues.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/utils/test/TestSampledValues.cpp
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /*
- *  Copyright (C) 2026 Team Kodi
- *  This file is part of Kodi - https://kodi.tv
+ *  Copyright (C) 2026 Hades
+ *  This file is part of LibreELEC Hades. It is not in Kodi as Team Kodi publishes it.
  *
  *  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
  *  See LICENSES/README.md for more information.
-- 
2.53.0

